0 -14 Td (## 7. Rationale Summary) Tj
0 -14 Td (This is not a value opportunity for you. It is a capital trap. The reasons are:) Tj
0 -14 Td (1. **Remediation costs exceed your entire remaining budget.** After purchasing for $890K, you would have $610K remaining. Remediation will cost $1.8M-$3.2M. You cannot fund the remediation.) Tj
0 -14 Td (2. **The discount is insufficient.** The vendor reduced the price by $510K. The contamination creates $1.8M-$3.2M in liability. You are being asked to accept $1.3M-$2.7M in unfunded liability.) Tj
0 -14 Td (3. **Your timeline is consumed by remediation.** Groundwater contamination requires 2-5 years of active treatment plus monitoring. Your 5-7 year hold period ends before development can begin.) Tj
0 -14 Td (4. **Benzene contamination triggers highest regulatory scrutiny.** BTEX contamination \(including benzene, a known carcinogen\) means EPA will require extensive remediation and long-term monitoring before approving any sensitive use.) Tj
